  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the sliced bell pepper and cook until tender, about 4 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced zucchini and cook until tender, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the diced tomato and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 4 minutes.",
    "Crumble the Vasterbottensost cheese into the skillet and stir until melted and creamy.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with pita bread."
